#: src/mp_gamestate.cpp:7990
msgid ""
"The game doesn't open the port until you're actually in the world, so anyone "
"who tries before that just gets \"connection refused\", even if your address "
"and port forwarding are perfectly correct.\n"
"\n"
"So finish world and character creation first.  Once you're in the world your "
"partner can join."
msgstr ""
"El juego no abre los puertos hasta que estes metido en el mundo, asi que "
"cualquiera que intente unirse antes recibe \"coneccion negada\", inclusive "
"si tu direccion ip y port forwarding estan perfectamente correctos.\n"
"\n"
"Asi que acaba el mundo y personaje primeros.  Una vez que estes metido en el "
"mundo tu compa se puede unir."

