#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:29
msgid ""
"CO-OP: untested third-party mod.  This mod is not bundled with the game and "
"has not been vetted for co-op; it may desync or crash the joining player.  "
"Both players must have the exact same mods installed."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: mapa de terceros sin testear.  Este mod no viene por defecto con el "
"juego y no ha sido testeado para co-op; podria causar desincronizacion o "
"crashear el juego del que se une.  Ambos jugadores deben tener los mismos "
"mods instalados."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:55
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Moves between the island and the mainland as "
"separate dimensions; co-op shares one world and cannot place the two players "
"in different dimensions."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE.  Mueve entre la isla y la tierra principal como "
"dimensiones separadas; co-op compare un solo mundo y no puede poner a los "
"dos jugadores en dimensiones distintas."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:60
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Every elevator descent teleports you into a freshly "
"generated instanced level; co-op's single shared map can't hold two players "
"on different levels."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE.  Cada descenso del elevador te teletransporta en un "
"nuevo nivel generado de instancias; el mapa compartido del co-op no puede "
"tener a dos jugadores en niveles distintos."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:65
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Leans heavily on teleport spells and scripted "
"(effect-on-condition) effects that don't apply to the remote player, and "
"long-range teleports break the shared map."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE.  Depende mucho de hechizos de teletransportar y "
"efectos programados que no se aplican al jugador remoto, y teletransportes a "
"larga distancia rompen el mapa compartido."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:70
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Psionic powers are scripted and run only on your own "
"client; teleportation powers break the shared map and self-heals desync from "
"the host."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE.  Los poderes Psionicos estan programados para que "
"solo  funcionen en tu cliente; los poderes de teletransportacion rompen el "
"mapa compartido y las auto-curaciones desincronizan del host."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:75
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Built on Mind Over Matter, which is not co-op "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE.  Basado en Mind Over Matter, el cual no es compatible "
"con co-op."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:80
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Paraclesian, vampire and dream powers are scripted "
"and run only on your own client, and several mechanics teleport you to "
"separate maps (dream realm, pocket dungeons)."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE. Los poderes de Paracelso, vampiro y de sueño estan "
"programados  para que solo anden en tu propio cliente, y varias de las "
"mecanicas te teletransportan a mapas separados (dimension del sueño, "
"calabozos de bolsillo)."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:85
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Aftershock's distinctive map specials (the exoplanet "
"start pads, alien biomes) aren't streamed host->client; the joining player's "
"world generates its own terrain at the same coordinates, so the two players "
"stand on completely different maps."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: NO COMPATIBLE. Los mapas especiales distinctivos de Aftershock (los "
"pads del principio del exoplaneta, los biomas alienigenas) no son enviados "
"del host > al cliente; el que se una genera su propio mundo con terreno en "
"las mismas coordenadas, asi que los dos jugadores acaban en mapas "
"completamente distintos."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:92
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Inherits Xedra Evolved's scripted powers, which don't "
"apply to the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  Recibe los poderes programados de Xedra Evolved, "
"los cuales no se aplican al jugador que se une."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:97
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Perk leveling is driven by kill events that aren't "
"credited to the remote player, so the joining player gains no perks."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  Los perks de nivelado son recibidos por eventos de "
"matanza que no son atribuidos al jugador que se une, asi que ese no recibe "
"perks."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:102
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Perk bonuses are applied by scripting that doesn't reach "
"the remote player, so the joining player's bonuses won't apply in shared "
"combat."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  Los bonos de perk son aplicados por programas que "
"no alcanzan al jugador que se une, asi que el jugador que se una no "
"compartira lo aplicado en combate."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:107
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Bionics aren't synced, so a joining player's passive "
"bonuses and active bionic powers won't apply on the host."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  Las Bionicas no estan sincronizadas, asi que los "
"bonos pasivos de un jugador que se una y las bionicas activas no se "
"aplicaran en el host."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:112
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  The mutagen-gland system runs only on your own client and "
"won't sync to the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa. El sistema de glandula-mutageno funciona solamente "
"en tu maquina, y no sincronizara con el jugador que se una."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:117
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Spell effects run only on your own client; only direct "
"damage reaches the shared world."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa. Los efectos de hechizo funcionan solamente en tu "
"maquina; solo daño directo alcanza el mundo compartido."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:122
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Some scripted effects (e.g. the immortal snail instant-"
"kill) don't apply to the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  Algunos efectos compartidos (por ejemplo, la muerte-"
"instantanea del caracol immortal)no se le aplica al jugador que se une."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:127
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Infection applies correctly, but its status and death-"
"warning UI may not show for the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa. La infeccion se aplica correctamente, pero su estado "
"y advertencia de muertequizas no se muestre al jugador que se une."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:132
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Pet ownership and control across two players is "
"unresolved; the joining player's tamed pets may be uncontrollable."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  La propiedad y control de las mascotas a travez de "
"dos jugadores es irresolvida; las mascotas del jugador que se une quizas "
"sean incontrolables."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:147
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  The scripted intro and the sleep-death mechanic run only "
"on the host and are skipped for the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: Quizas se rompa.  La intro programada y la mecanica de muerte por "
"sueño funcionan solo en el host y son saltadas para el jugador que se une."

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:152
msgid ""
"CO-OP: minor issues.  Most works, but on-kill style buffs aren't credited to "
"the remote player."
msgstr ""
"CO-OP: problemas menores.  La mayoria funciona, pero los efectos causados "
"por matar no son acreditados al jugador que se une."

