msgstr ""
"<color_pink>CO-OP:</color> \"Pausa\" ('5' or '.') es crucial para co-op.  Le "
"da a tu compa movimientos/AP. Y viceversa."

#. Co-op tip shown on the loading screen and main menu.
#. Keep the <color_pink>CO-OP:</color> prefix exactly as-is; translate only
#. the sentence after it.
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"<color_pink>CO-OP:</color> The host runs the entire world simulation… So "
"host with the faster machine w/ the better connection."
msgstr ""
"<color_pink>CO-OP:</color> El host corre la simulacion del mundo entero… Asi "
"que hostee el que tenga la maquina mas rapida con la mejor conexion."

#. Co-op tip shown on the loading screen and main menu.
#. Keep the <color_pink>CO-OP:</color> prefix exactly as-is; translate only
#. the sentence after it.
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"<color_pink>CO-OP:</color> If you're both asleep or in long activities, the "
"game will fast-forward so you're not stuck waiting in real time."
msgstr ""
"<color_pink>CO-OP:</color> Si ambos estan durmiendo o haciendo actividades "
"prolongadas, el juego va a ir mas rapido asi no estan ambos esperando en "
"tiempo real."

#. Co-op tip shown on the loading screen and main menu.
#. Keep the <color_pink>CO-OP:</color> prefix exactly as-is; translate only
#. the sentence after it.
#: data/core/tips.json
